# D-FREED-INODE-HOME-NEVER-PUBLISHED-LIVE-CORE-AFTER-CLEAN-UNMOUNT, H-F6: a
# local-unlink inactivation whose grant was lost since the unlink trusts its
# in-core image after the peer, the file's last closer through a touch by name,
# already freed the life; the dead life's live core goes home over the free
# (ng0rf1, nlink 0).  Same-build A/B of module knob inact_local_epoch_guard
# with tests/peer_last_closer_ab.sh (its header states the window and the
# grades): guard 0 is the control, 1 the fix, both with the two delay knobs.
#
# VERDICT RULES (written before the first lap):
#   PROVEN    a control lap reaches peer-freed on the unlinker (not VACUOUS)
#             and audits CORRUPT with P-FREE-LIVE-CORE, AND every fix lap
#             reaches peer-freed and audits CLEAN with no node failure
#   REFUTED   the control laps reach peer-freed (>= 20 verdicts in aggregate)
#             and every one audits CLEAN: H-F6 does not produce the shape, and
#             ng0rf1 needs another cause
#   FIX FAILS a fix lap that reached peer-freed audits CORRUPT
#   OPEN      every lap VACUOUS: the window does not reach the branch; redesign
#             the workload before judging
# A lap whose audit is STALE/NONE has no verdict and is rerun.
#
# The first four laps (pcc1 pcf1 pcc2 pcf2, ~/src/mxfs-b, build
# 5E921ECCDAAA8C14D163D4C) were all VACUOUS, i.e. OPEN: the delay sat inside
# the unlinker's inactivation, where the toucher's EX BAST is parked
# (P-NOINO-LIFECYCLE class=NEED_INACTIVE on test15 for every touched inode).
# Redesigned: the delay now holds the unlink after its commit with the inode
# still live (dbg_unlink_live_delay_ms), where ng0rf1 lost the grant.  The
# rules above are unchanged.
#
# Bound per lap, the sum of the harness's own step bounds, every ssh step
# counted: prep_cluster 300 + srcversion reads 2x20 + knob sets 2x20 + mkdir 30
# + workload 40 x (150+1000+1500) ms + 60 = 166 + counters 2x40 + knob resets
# 2x20 + chk_clean with alloc_witness 150 + stream capture 2x120 = 1086 s.
1090 tests/peer_last_closer_ab.sh pwc1 0 40 2/disk/caw/direct g2b
1090 tests/peer_last_closer_ab.sh pwf1 1 40 2/disk/caw/direct g2b
1090 tests/peer_last_closer_ab.sh pwc2 0 40 2/disk/caw/direct g2b
1090 tests/peer_last_closer_ab.sh pwf2 1 40 2/disk/caw/direct g2b
